<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0685_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chad</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? Is that a Pokédex? You MET\nProfessor Oak?\rYou HAVE?\nWhat did he smell like?\rI dream of bein’ a homie researcher\nlike Professor Oak.\rCan I please get your number?\nWe can talk about him. FOR HOURS. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You listen to Professor Oak’s Homie\nTalk, right? I record every episode.\fOn cassette.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... I wish I could meet Professor\nOak... I got his poster. I kiss it\fgoodnight. Respectfully.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Can I please get your number?\rWe should chat about Professor\nOak. It’s gon’ be mad fun! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\nWait, ain’t you right nearby?\fYou like the phone that much?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I just started watchin’ wild {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}.\rI been learnin’ all kinds of new stuff\nfrom watchin’.\fI wear a lab coat to do it.\rI wish I could be a researcher like\nProfessor Oak soon.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah, I knocked out a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\na while back.\rWith all the studyin’ I do, it was\nbound to happen. Professor Oak would\fbe proud. He don’t know me.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah, I almost caught\na wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}, but it dipped.\rI been wantin’ to study\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} FOREVER. Man...\rLater!\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know Blue?\rHe Professor Oak’s GRANDSON and a\nformer Big League Kingpin!\fI asked him for an autograph.\fHe said “smell ya later.” I framed it.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak got a granddaughter\nnamed Daisy.\rWhen she around, even the most\nferocious homies calm down.\fI wrote her a letter. About her\ngrandpa.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everybody talkin’ about Professor Elm.\rHe used to be Professor Oak’s\nASSISTANT!\rThat’s HARD! I’m jealous! I’d do his\nlaundry for free!\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak’s dream is a complete\nPokédex.\rI’m jealous you part of that project...\nVERY jealous. Like, a normal amount.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know Kurt, the custom bag maker?\rHim and Professor Oak go WAY back.\nI guess greatness attract greatness!\fI tried to attract greatness. A bee\fcame instead.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Big League is where Hustlers go to\nbecome Kingpin.\rProfessor Oak is a ADVISOR to the Big\nLeague’s headquarters.\rHe’s a great man.\nThe greatest. I’ll fight you on this.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak’s Homie Talk is a\npopular radio show, right?\rYou know he almost\nturned the show down at first?\rBut Mary’s energy and persistence\nwore him down.\fSo we got Mary to thank for it!\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak used to be a Hustler a\nlong time ago.\rBut instead of scrappin’, he found\nhomies themselves more interestin’.\rSo he quit trainin’ to focus\non bein’ a researcher.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak got a granddaughter\nnamed Daisy.\rShe have tea every day for a hour\nstartin’ at three in the afternoon.\rI wish I could join her for tea and\nchat about Professor Oak.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know?\nProfessor Oak traveled all over the\fworld when he was young.\rWhile travelin’, he musta learned\nabout homies naturally.\rI’m jealous... I’d like to travel and\nlearn stuff too...\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know?\nProfessor Oak traveled all over the\fworld when he was young.\rWhile travelin’, he musta learned\nabout homies naturally.\rI’m jealous... I’d like to travel and\nlearn stuff too...\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna scrap?\rI gotta scrap every now and then\nso I don’t get rusty.\rI’ll be on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You remember our scrap?\rThe spot is {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nHurry up--I’m waitin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0685_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m finna study ALL about homies so\nProfessor Oak make me his\fassistant!</language>
	</row>
</body>
